  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian National Police's Criminal Investigation Agency (Bareskrim) is currently investigating a high-profile treason case involving former National Police Chief Listyo Sigit Prabowo and five additional suspects. Officials allege that the group orchestrated a multi-stage plan, including the mapping of influential figures and the use of digital campaigns to destabilize the government. Investigators recovered documents outlining crisis management strategies and references to the 1998 political unrest that led to the resignation of President Soeharto. Following raids on 14 locations, including five identified as command posts, authorities claim the suspects intended to infiltrate public demonstrations. The investigation has expanded to include cyber-related charges, with six accounts allegedly used to attack the government, and the involvement of a civilian suspect in illegal surveillance activities.",
